    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a landmark move to advance experiential learning and promote industry-academia collaboration, The Aga Khan University and Salim Habib University (SHU) have signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) to provide biomedical engineering students with hands-on training and research opportunities at AKU's Centre for Innovation in Medical Education (CIME).",
